{
 "help": "usage: wgsextract ref library [-h] [--install INSTALL] [--list] [--remote-sizes] [--delete GENOME]\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help         show this help message and exit\n  --install INSTALL  Non-interactively install a genome by its code (e.g., hs38) or index (e.g.,\n                     9).\n  --list             Non-interactively list all available genomes and their status.\n  --remote-sizes     Look up download sizes online (cached 30 days; at most ~8 s).\n  --delete GENOME    Delete a catalog genome (code or file name) and its indexes.\n\nglobal options:\n  -i/--input, -o/--outdir, --genome, --ref, -t/--threads, -m/--memory, --json, --quiet, --debug,\n  --config and the other global options are accepted before or after the command; 'wgsextract\n  --help' lists them all.\n\nexamples:\n  wgsextract ref library --list\n  wgsextract ref library --install hs38\n\noutputs (in the output directory unless noted):\n  Into the reference library (reflib): the chosen reference genome and its\n  indexes.\n\nneeds:\n  bcftools, bgzip, curl, htsfile, samtools, tabix; depends on download speed.\n",
